  "name": "Claude Usage Statusline",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Displays real-time usage percentages (5h session, 7d weekly, context window), reset countdowns, burn rate, and exhaustion prediction in your Claude Code terminal status line. Features smart caching to prevent flickering when the API temporarily returns 0% between updates.",
